<title>HONG KONG: ING Barings sets HSBC Holdings warrants.</title>
<headline>ING Barings sets HSBC Holdings warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings Securities (Hong Kong) Ltd said on Thursday it had issued 27.5 million American-style call warrants on HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$227	   PREMIUM	 13.68 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$3.10	  GEARING	 7.31x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   29.MAY.98	ISSUE DATE    25.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	EXER LOT	4,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$227	   LAUNCH DATE   29.MAY.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW	HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT. PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p>TWO OR THERE WEEKS AFTER LAUNCH DATE</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
